        "TileImage": "$($repository 6c09bd70-6670-486b-9222-15db93222b56).Image",
        "Description": "Tobias, if you&apos;re reading this, that means you still have time\r\rThese two have kidnapped you and have taken you to a hospital in Hokkaido under the false claim that you are a dead hiker so they can test their new drug on you, give them a taste of their own medicine and escape on my snowmobile, you MUST cover your tracks so erase all evidence, hide all bodies, and keep your clothes, those have your DNA all over them so keep them on, and be quick about this, idk if you got much time\r\r-Anonymous",
